{
  "mn73:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 73 ",
  "mn73:0.2": "Mahāvacchasutta ",
  "mn73:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn73:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā rājagahe viharati veḷuvane kalandakanivāpe. ",
  "mn73:2.1": "Atha kho vacchagotto paribbājako yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "mn73:2.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho vacchagotto paribbājako bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn73:3.1": "“dīgharattāhaṁ bhotā gotamena sahakathī. ",
  "mn73:3.2": "Sādhu me bhavaṁ gotamo saṅkhittena kusalākusalaṁ desetū”ti. ",
  "mn73:3.3": "“Saṅkhittenapi kho te ahaṁ, vaccha, kusalākusalaṁ deseyyaṁ, vitthārenapi kho te ahaṁ, vaccha, kusalākusalaṁ deseyyaṁ; ",
  "mn73:3.4": "api ca te ahaṁ, vaccha, saṅkhittena kusalākusalaṁ desessāmi. ",
  "mn73:3.5": "Taṁ suṇāhi, sādhukaṁ manasi karohi, bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
  "mn73:3.6": "“Evaṁ, bho”ti kho vacchagotto paribbājako bhagavato paccassosi. ",
  "mn73:3.7": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn73:4.1": "“Lobho kho, vaccha, akusalaṁ, alobho kusalaṁ; ",
  "mn73:4.2": "doso kho, vaccha, akusalaṁ, adoso kusalaṁ; ",
  "mn73:4.3": "moho kho, vaccha, akusalaṁ, amoho kusalaṁ. ",
  "mn73:4.4": "Iti kho, vaccha, ime tayo dhammā akusalā, tayo dhammā kusalā. ",
  "mn73:5.1": "Pāṇātipāto kho, vaccha, akusalaṁ, pāṇātipātā veramaṇī kusalaṁ; ",
  "mn73:5.2": "adinnādānaṁ kho, vaccha